Mobile Set Editor
=================

Mobile Set Editor is an Android port of Magic Set Editor 2.

Copyright (C) Twan van Laarhoven and the other Magic Set Editor developers,
including haganbmj and GenevensiS, and the Mobile Set Editor
contributors.

License
-------

The combined work is distributed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or (at your option) any later version (GPL-3.0-or-later). The full
text is in COPYING.

Files inherited from Magic Set Editor carry headers saying "GNU General Public
License 2 or later". Those files remain available under GPL-2.0-or-later on
their own; this repository distributes them, together with everything else,
under the version 3 option. New files written for Mobile Set Editor (the
Android app, the facade and their tests) are GPL-3.0-or-later only. Version 3
is required because the Android app links Apache-2.0 libraries (Kotlin
standard library, AndroidX, Jetpack Compose), which are compatible with GPLv3
but not with GPLv2.

Third-party components
----------------------

- third_party/minizip-ng: minizip-ng, under the zlib license (see its LICENSE).
- test/fixture/fonts: DejaVu fonts, under the DejaVu fonts license (see
  test/fixture/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt). Used by the tests only; never shipped.

Templates
---------

No game or style templates are included or downloaded. Users import template
packs they obtained themselves.

